  "body": "## What changed\n\n`edit_machine` accepts the machine file's `edm.codes` key.\n`get_job` and the edit reply show codes under that same key.\nThe edit rejects the old top-level `edm_codes` key with a message that names the supported key.\nThe edit validates code names and text before the undoable mount.\nProject machine storage stays unchanged.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe MCP tools used the internal machine serialization directly.\nThat serialization stored codes under `edm_codes`, while machine files and post diagnostics used `edm.codes`.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `nested_edm_codes_merge_read_back_undo_and_post_through_wire_iso` pins merge, readback, undo, redo, null removal, and actual MCP posting.\n- `bad_nested_edm_codes_are_named_and_leave_the_machine_unchanged` pins named refusals and unchanged state.\n- Both pins failed on unchanged production code. Both pass with the fix.\n- Restoring both old production files made the pins fail. Restoring the fix made them pass.\n- Restoring only the old readback view made the flow pin fail. Restoring the fix made it pass.\n- Removing each guard made a pin fail: legacy key, map type, text type, and code validity. Each restoration passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 22 steps.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\nEffort: high. The safety floor applies because EDM control codes can change posted G-code.\n\n## Review validation on final head\n\nHead: `660cbf989ccd106bc37def1958104a2c4dc50fc9` (unchanged).\nBase: `upstream/main` at `5e76e6a14b366c510858bbbf660c06ca013c34d4`.\n\n`cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main` passed locally.\nAll 200 steps passed their gate criteria, including the release build and all selected app heavy targets.\nThe run took 27.8 minutes. Tests reported 43 passed and four expected known failures. No test was ignored.\nThe other heavy targets ran no selected tests. Documentation tests passed with no selected tests.\n\n| Heavy suite with selected tests | Passed |\n|---|---:|\n| `adaptive_fig8_crossing` | 2 |\n| `adaptive_pinch` | 1 |\n| `carried_engine_agreement` | 1 |\n| `example_catalog` | 2 |\n| `feature_pick_wire` | 1 |\n| `import_solidcraft` | 3 |\n| `large_models` | 1 |\n| `lathe_field_sim` | 1 |\n| `lathe_workholding_kinds` | 1 |\n| `operations` | 6 |\n| `pick_agnostic` | 2 |\n| `pocket3d_hsm` | 1 |\n| `rotary_field_parity` | 6 |\n| `shared_face_bodies_finish` | 6 |\n| `shoulder_adaptive` | 1 |\n| `stock_engine_agreement` | 3 |\n| `stock_field_cost` | 1 |\n| `stock_play_precalc` | 1 |\n| `verify` | 2 |\n| `whole_model_pocket` | 1 |\n\nThe gate accepted these four registered known failures. No unexpected test failed.\n\n- #2849: `an_axis_aligned_lead_start_posts_the_users_arc_entry_as_g18_or_g19`.\n- #2849: `the_horizontal_arc_entry_on_the_users_pocket_verifies_silent`.\n- #2849: `fig8_outside_containment_with_em0800_and_clearing_kinds_works`.\n- #1950: `the_users_whole_model_bore_roughs_adaptive_on_each_level`.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed again: 22 steps, 388 tests, no failures.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed again on this head.\nThe review requested validation and effort metadata only. No production code or test changed.\nThe existing pins and their mutation results remain listed above.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff contains no `.nc` or `.cl` golden changes.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo physical EDM control or machine was tested.\nThe posting pin uses the repository's fictional codes.\nThe release gate was not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #3165, #3108, #3103, #3033, #2836, and #2714 touch `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs`.\nEach touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nThis change edits `machine_view`. Those PRs edit `setups_view`, `finding`, `get_job`, or `list_operation_types`.\nNo open PR changes the other files.\n\nChangelog: MCP machine edits and readback use edm.codes for EDM control words and name invalid code entries.\n\nFixes #3212\n\n",
